# Neura-X: Intelligence Without Limits.
# Copyright (c) 2026 Edusei Mikel Lisamba. All Rights Reserved.
#
# Monorepo .gitignore — v2
# Covers: Python, C, C++, Rust, LLVM, CMake, IDEs, OS, Neura-X artifacts
#
# Policy notes:
#   - assets/ (logo, brand) is ALWAYS committed.
#   - docs/benchmarks/logs/ (raw benchmark logs) is ALWAYS committed.
#   - Cargo.lock files ARE committed (reproducible wheel builds).
#   - .nex model files are ignored only if you uncomment section 5.
#
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════


