# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 16. REPOSITORY EXCEPTIONS (ALWAYS COMMITTED)
#     These negations come LAST so they override every rule above.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Brand assets (logo, banners, icons)
!assets/
!assets/**

# Raw benchmark logs are part of the scientific record
!docs/benchmarks/logs/
!docs/benchmarks/logs/**

# Example environment template (safe, no secrets)
!.env.example

# Small committed sample datasets for tutorials/tests
!examples/data/
!examples/data/**
!python/tests/data/
!python/tests/data/**

# SVG logos must survive the Vim swap-file pattern
!*.svg